# Week 4 : Product Performance Analysis

## 1. Objective
Analyse product sales contribution, relative movement, and unusual
sales-value patterns using the integrated sales dataset.

## 2. Data scope
- Source: sales_orders_integrated_03.csv
- Products analysed: 30
- Delivered rows used in the product summary: 114,543
- Distinct delivered orders: 17,557
- Analysis period: 2019-01-01 to
  2024-12-31
- Cancelled records were excluded from the primary analysis.
- Product movement counts distinct sales orders, not line items.
- One missing line_sales_value was excluded from sales calculations.
- Currency has not been assumed from the column name.

## 3. Product performance
Products were ranked by total delivered sales value across the available
history. The summary includes delivered quantity, sales value, sales share,
distinct delivered orders, active sales days, and sale dates.

Total delivered sales value: 22,347,621,930.00

## 4. ABC / Pareto classification
Products were ranked by lifetime delivered sales value.
- Class A targets approximately the first 80% of sales value.
- Class B targets the next portion up to approximately 95%.
- Class C contains the remaining products.
- Product boundaries mean actual class percentages may differ from targets.

           product_count   sales_value  sales_share_pct
abc_class                                              
